<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-048" chapter-id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo" source-id="s-songshu-048-zhuchuo-ws1791560">
  <p id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0000" ref="wip_vh5_2zm_A">齡石</persName>父<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0003" ref="wip_vh5_2zm">綽</persName>逃走歸<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0007" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>，攻戰常居先，不避矢石。壽陽平，<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0024" ref="2c9_218_9b3">真</persName>已死，<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0028" ref="wip_vh5_2zm">綽</persName>輒發棺戮尸，<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0035" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>怒，將斬之，<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0042" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>弟<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0044" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">沖</persName>苦請得免。<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0050" ref="wip_vh5_2zm">綽</persName>為人忠烈，受<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0057" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">沖</persName>更生之恩，事<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0064" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">沖</persName>如父。參<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0069" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">沖</persName>車騎軍事、西陽廣平太守。及<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0083" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">沖</persName>薨，<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuchuo:p001:m0086" ref="wip_vh5_2zm">綽</persName>歐血死。</p>
</text>
